      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i just feel like everything is empty. i used to believe there was a reason for all this, like something was watching over me or something, but that's all gone now. it's just dark and quiet and there's nothing. i wake up and it just hits me that none of it actually matters. it feels so heavy.",
